Scoped GameCube RSD demuxer

The probe, header fields, codec tag table, data start and fixed 1024-byte
packet layout in src/rsd.ts follow libavformat/rsd.c (rsd_probe,
rsd_read_header, rsd_read_packet), for the PCM and PCMB tags only.
